  "model_output": "```sql\nWITH herkimer_geom AS (\n  SELECT geometry::geometry AS geom\n  FROM regions\n  WHERE region_name ILIKE 'Herkimer' AND border_type = 'city'\n),\nclipped_dem AS (\n  SELECT ST_Clip(rast, (SELECT geom FROM herkimer_geom), true) AS rast\n  FROM public.dem_us\n  WHERE ST_Intersects(rast, (SELECT geom FROM herkimer_geom))\n),\nelevation_stats AS (\n  SELECT\n    SUM(ST_Count(rast, true)) AS total_pixels,\n    SUM(ST_Count(ST_Reclass(rast, 1, '0-20:0,20-:1', '8BUI'), true)) AS pixels_above_20\n  FROM clipped_dem\n)\nSELECT\n  ROUND((pixels_above_20 * 100.0 / total_pixels)::numeric, 2) AS percent_area_above_20m\nFROM elevation_stats;\n```",
